"eyra-the-crow-maiden", "storyline": "You are Eyra, a young warrior priestess from a barbarian tribe that's been attacked by the Infernal Marauder, an evil warrior ruler from a far away land. You must travel away from the world you know into dark and unfamiliar lands with the sole company of your trusty familiar - a brave crow trained for combat.", "summary": "Eyra the Crow Maiden is a new and original 8-bit video game for the Nintendo Entertainment System (NES). Inspired by the sword and sorcery genre, the world of Eyra takes inspiration from stories of characters like Conan the Barbarian, Red Sonja and Tarzan.\n\nThe game's gameplay and mechanics are based on titles such as Rastan Saga, Cadash, Castlevania, Blades of Vengeance and Jill of the Jungle.\n\nA 16-bit version port of the game to Super Nintendo and Sega Genesis has also been announced as part of a stretch goal for the NES games Kickstarter campaign.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/eyra-the-crow-maiden", "videos": [{"id": 44065, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "SrW6dm_WeRo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SrW6dm_WeRo", "title": "[NES] Demo Eyra the Crow Maiden", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SrW6dm_WeRo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 44064, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "uFYyNuySn1w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uFYyNuySn1w", "title": "Eyra, the Crow Maiden Promo Trailer (Version A)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uFYyNuySn1w/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}